{"id":"n66029-1-9","stage":1,"title":"라디오 · 电台广播","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66029-1-9-1","ko":"어제 라디오에 내가 좋아하는 가수가 나왔잖아.","zh":"昨天我喜欢的歌手上广播节目了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"라디오에","meaning":"电台广播","explanation":"라디오：电台广播；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"라디오","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66029","senseId":"1","lemma":"라디오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가수가","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나왔잖아.","meaning":"出来，播放出来","explanation":"나오다：出来，播放出来；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"22","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"6314a358f4e72c51","term":"라디오","zh":"电台广播","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3","entryId":"66029","definition":"广