}]},{"text":"보낸","meaning":"发送","explanation":"보내다：发送；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"10","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"2","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听说","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"接收他人口头上的传达内容。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"0793bce18be02a79","term":"신청","zh":"申请","audio":"/audio/0793bce18be02a79f122.mp3","entryId":"65346","definition":"向团体或机关等正式要求办理某事。","pronunciation":["신청"]},{"id":"f999131395275fd1","term":"곡","zh":"首，支","audio":"/audio/f999131395275fd13fe3.mp3","entryId":"25581","definition":"计算歌曲或音乐作品的数量单位。","pronunciation":["곡"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"发送","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"使内容被传达。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"66342","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d5e45516925745cbf1d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.248,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66029","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":43,"sequenceScore":1.9014,"questions":[{"l